 dir=3D"ltr"><b><strong>MongoDB operators </strong></b><span>are like tools=
 that help you work with your data effectively. They allow you to find spec=
ific information, make changes and analyze your data in MongoDB. </span></p=
><p dir=3D"ltr"><span>Mastering these operators gives you the ability to ma=
nage and explore your data more efficiently, uncovering valuable insights a=
long the way.</span></p><h3><span>1. Comparison Operators</span></h3><p dir=
=3D"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>Find documents where age is g=
reater than 30 in 'users' collection</span></p><pre><span>db.users.find({ a=
