n><a href=3D"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/mongodb/mongodb-not-operator-not=
/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener"><span>NOT </span></a><span>equal to 3=
0 in 'users' collection</span></p><pre><span>db.users.find({ age: { $not: {=
 $eq: 30 } } })</span></pre><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><=
span>Find documents where age is neither 30 nor 31 in 'users' collection</s=
pan></p><pre><span>db.users.find({ age: { $nor: [ { $eq: 30 }, { $eq: 31 } =
