tify;"><span>We use the $add, $subtract, $multiply, and $divide operators t=
o perform addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division respectively =
on numeric fields. The $abs operator calculates the absolute value of numer=
ic fields.</span></p><h3><span>4. Field Update Operators</span></h3><p dir=
=3D"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>Let's Update the age of users=
 to the maximum value of 40 in 'users' collection</span></p><pre><span>db.u=
