ify;"><span>Let's Reverse the 'tags' array in all documents of 'posts' coll=
ection</span></p><pre><span>db.posts.updateMany({}, { $reverseArray: "$tags=
" })</span></pre><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>We use=
 the </span><a href=3D"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/mongodb/mongodb-isarra=
y-operator/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener"><span>$isArray</span></a><s=
pan> operator to find documents where a field is an array. The $size operat=
