"noopener"><span> $reverseArray</span></a><span> reverses the elements of a=
n array.</span></p><h3><span>6. Array Update Operators</span></h3><p dir=3D=
"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>Let's Remove all occurrences of =
"</span><b><strong>mongodb</strong></b><span>" from the 'tags' array in 'po=
sts' collection</span></p><pre><span>db.posts.updateMany({}, { $pull: { tag=
