rray in '</span><b><strong>posts</strong></b><span>' collection</span></p><=
pre><span>db.posts.updateMany({}, { $pullAll: { tags: ["nosql", "database"]=
 } })</span></pre><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>Let's=
 Add "</span><b><strong>newtag</strong></b><span>" to the end of the '</spa=
n><b><strong>tags</strong></b><span>' array in a specific document in '</sp=
an><b><strong>posts</strong></b><span>' collection</span></p><pre><span>db.=
