   }</span><br><span>    }</span><br><span>])</span></pre><p dir=3D"ltr" st=
yle=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>Let's Compare the 'title' field case ins=
ensitively to "</span><b><strong>MongoDB</strong></b><span>" in 'posts' col=
lection</span></p><pre><span>db.posts.find({ $expr: { $eq: [{ $strcasecmp: =
