ltr" style=3D"text-align: justify;"><span>We use the</span><a href=3D"https=
://www.geeksforgeeks.org/mongodb/mongodb-concat-operator/" target=3D"_blank=
" rel=3D"noopener"><b><strong> $concat </strong></b></a><span>operator to c=
oncatenate fields or strings.</span><a href=3D"https://www.geeksforgeeks.or=
g/mongodb/mongodb-strcasecmp-operator/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener">=
<b><strong> $strcasecmp</strong></b></a><span> compares strings case insens=
